        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset 598-S SmartKey Single Cylinder Gatelatch Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis SmartKey single cylinder Kwikset made deadbolt is made for gates such as swimming pool gates or apartment buildings. It is always locked and requires a key to unlock it from the outside. Good for gates with 2-3/8 inch backsets with 1-3/8 inch to 1-3/4 inch thicknesses.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis <b>Smartkey</b> Kwikset Lock offers convenience and security. It allows you to re-key the lock yourself without removing from the door; this mean you will be able to key all your SmartKey locks to one Kwikset key.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Deadbolt:</b> This deadbolt is always locked and requires a key to unlock it from the outside of the door. It can be unlocked by a thumbturn from the interior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/gatelatch-double-cylinder-deadbolt-kwikset-599-s\"><b>Double Cylinder Gatelatch Deadbolt</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Kwikset 598-S Gate Lock:\r\n<ul> \r\n<li>SmartKey Bump Resistant Lock Cylinder</li>\r\n<li>1\" front Gatelatch</li>\r\n<li>Free Spinning Cylinder Guard Security</li>\r\n<li>ANSI/BHMA A156.2 Grade 2 Security</li>\r\n<li>T Strike</li>\r\n<li>Reversible, Non-handed</li>\r\n<li>Meets ADA Requirements</li>\r\n<li>Sold as Complete Set</li>\r\n<li>Easy to Install</li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacture Lifetime Mechanical & Finish Warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Self Locking Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 1-5/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Thumb Turn Length: 1-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" </li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Fits 2-1/8\" or 1-1/2\" Crossbore Hole</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>** This item is discontinued. Very limited quantities available.</b>\r\n</p><p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
